); ?></dd></dl></div></details><?php endforeach; ?></div></section>

<section class="single-herbs-guide__section" aria-labelledby="topic-eight-formulas-title"><h4 id="topic-eight-formulas-title"><?php echo s($summertext('When the herb leads the formula', 'Cuando la hierba dirige la fórmula')); ?></h4><p class="single-herbs-guide__section-lead"><?php echo s($summertext('Only chief or co-chief connections within the current 63-formula Board roster appear here.', 'Aquí aparecen solamente relaciones principales o coprincipales dentro del listado Board vigente de 63 fórmulas.')); ?></p><div class="single-herbs-guide__formula-leads"><article class="single-herbs-guide__formula-lead"><h5>Qing Hao + Bie Jia</h5><p><strong>Qing Hao Bie Jia Tang:</strong> <?php echo s($summertext('current Board formula in which Qing Hao vents latent Heat while Bie Jia nourishes Yin. This is a cross-category connection, not a generic Summerheat formula.', 'fórmula Board vigente donde Qing Hao exterioriza Calor latente mientras Bie Jia nutre Yin. Es una conexión entre categorías, no una fórmula genérica para Calor de Verano.')); ?></p></article></div><p class="single-herbs-guide__scope-note"><strong><?php echo s($summertext('Roster boundary:', 'Límite del listado:')); ?></strong> <?php echo s($summertext('No other chief or co-chief connection for these six module herbs belongs to the current 63-formula Domain list.', 'Ninguna otra relación principal o coprincipal para estas seis hierbas pertenece al listado vigente de 63 fórmulas del Domain.')); ?></p></section>

